\newlabel{fig:persona}{{5}{9}{\textbf {The persona effect against the payoff scale.} The persona effect is the cooperation rate under a cooperative persona minus that under a selfish one. (a) The effect against the payoff scale, each point averaging 200 dyads; the shaded band marks the two scales at which every payoff printed is at most 1. (b) The same contrast as two regime means: open markers at $\lam \leq 0.1$, filled markers at $\lam \geq 0.25$ (table~\ref {tab:persona})}{figure.5}{}}
